                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any plant in genera Polianthes or Manfreda (syns. of Agave), now both in Agave subg. Manfreda.",
                                            "especially Agave amica (syn. Poliantes tuberosa), that has white flowers and grass-like leaves, used in perfumery."
                                        ],
